    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MudBlood Prologue is an adult sandbox and management game set in a medieval fantasy world, where the player is in control of a goblin tribe that lives inside a cave. Perform raids on neighbouring roads, villages and cities, grow your army to expand your control over the territory and collect resources to expand the cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using specific potions, you can randomize or you can manually customize your female characters appearance. Create your favourite body by choosing the skin tone, tweaking the breast, ass, arms, thighs, and body type. You can also choose various face types, hair, eye colors and select various clothes for your females. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/4c85a8775647c326c6e100a175142d24.poster.avif?t=1752707886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/4c85a8775647c326c6e100a175142d24.webm?t=1752707886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/4c85a8775647c326c6e100a175142d24.mp4?t=1752707886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your army</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed the monsters with the females to obtain stronger offspring! You can choose various spots like the many brothel stations, the normal breeding spots and the milking stations.There are various female and monster races, combine them together to create hybrids. Using the extracted milk increase the stats of your new monsters. Increase the females depravity value to get different animations and facial expressions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/a8427f85a928e16eb7a9bd2ee4ed0cb9.poster.avif?t=1752707886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/a8427f85a928e16eb7a9bd2ee4ed0cb9.webm?t=1752707886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/a8427f85a928e16eb7a9bd2ee4ed0cb9.mp4?t=1752707886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid locations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get potions, materials, and random females, just raid locations with your army, and in the meantime collect all the Unique Females available in the various raid spots.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MudBlood Prologue is an adult sandbox and management game set in a medieval fantasy world, where the player is in control of a goblin tribe that lives inside a cave. Perform raids on neighbouring roads, villages and cities, grow your army to expand your control over the territory and collect resources to expand the cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using specific potions, you can randomize or you can manually customize your female characters appearance. Create your favourite body by choosing the skin tone, tweaking the breast, ass, arms, thighs, and body type. You can also choose various face types, hair, eye colors and select various clothes for your females. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/4c85a8775647c326c6e100a175142d24.poster.avif?t=1752707886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/4c85a8775647c326c6e100a175142d24.webm?t=1752707886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/4c85a8775647c326c6e100a175142d24.mp4?t=1752707886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your army</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed the monsters with the females to obtain stronger offspring! You can choose various spots like the many brothel stations, the normal breeding spots and the milking stations.There are various female and monster races, combine them together to create hybrids. Using the extracted milk increase the stats of your new monsters. Increase the females depravity value to get different animations and facial expressions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/a8427f85a928e16eb7a9bd2ee4ed0cb9.poster.avif?t=1752707886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/a8427f85a928e16eb7a9bd2ee4ed0cb9.webm?t=1752707886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209970/extras/a8427f85a928e16eb7a9bd2ee4ed0cb9.mp4?t=1752707886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid locations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get potions, materials, and random females, just raid locations with your army, and in the meantime collect all the Unique Females available in the various raid spots.</p>",
